WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for disc01_03h.avi
Scene: Missile preparation and launch readiness
Estimated duration: 24 seconds
No dialogue in this scene

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The interior of the Missile Base is revealed. Enormous intercontinental missiles sit vertically in their massive launch silos, each towering several stories high.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The missiles are sleek, pointed weapons painted in military gray and white. Red and yellow warning stripes mark their hulls.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Galbadian technicians in uniforms work frantically at control panels and computer stations. Soldiers move through the facility with urgent purpose. Warning lights flash in amber and red throughout the base.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Electronic countdown sequences appear on monitors. Numbers decrease in a race toward launch. Alarms sound periodically.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The missiles are primed and ready for deployment, aimed directly at Balamb Garden and Trabia Garden. The facility hums with the energy of active military operations preparing for strike.
